<title>TURKEY: Trading resumes in Garanti in Istanbul.</title>
<headline>Trading resumes in Garanti in Istanbul.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Istanbul's Stock Exchange said trading resumed in shares of Turkiye Garanti Bankasi AS, a leading Turkish bank, at 0830 gmt, after temporarily closed before the Exchange's open.</p>
</text>
